<view class="organize-page">
  <view class="organize-header">
    <view class="organize-header-line"><text class="organize-eyebrow">从现场记录，到我的动作卡</text><text class="organize-status {{confirmed ? 'organize-status-done' : ''}}">{{confirmed ? '已核对' : '待核对'}}</text></view>
    <text class="organize-title">整理现场记录</text><text class="organize-subtitle">视频先留住，资料收到后再补全</text>
    <view class="organize-path"><text class="organize-path-active">留视频</text><text class="organize-path-arrow">›</text><text>补资料</text><text class="organize-path-arrow">›</text><text>核对要求</text></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{confirmed}}" class="organize-tabs"><text data-tab="learn" bindtap="selectTab" class="{{tab === 'learn' ? 'organize-tab-selected' : ''}}">学 · 动作资料</text><text data-tab="practice" bindtap="selectTab" class="{{tab === 'practice' ? 'organize-tab-selected' : ''}}">练</text><text data-tab="check" bindtap="selectTab" class="{{tab === 'check' ? 'organize-tab-selected' : ''}}">查</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="organize-error">{{error}}</view>
  <block wx:if="{{tab === 'learn'}}">
    <view class="organize-card organize-video-card">
      <view class="organize-section-heading"><view class="organize-section-name"><text class="organize-step">01</text><text class="organize-heading">现场视频</text></view><text class="organize-caption">先保存，再慢慢整理</text></view>
      <picker wx:if="{{videoOptions.length > 1}}" range="{{videoOptions}}" range-key="name" value="{{videoIndex}}" bindchange="selectVideo" class="organize-video-picker"><view class="organize-video-picker-line"><text class="organize-video-label">{{videoLabel}}</text><text class="organize-link">{{sourceSchemeDocument ? '关联视频⌄' : '切换录段⌄'}}</text></view></picker>
      <video wx:if="{{video}}" src="{{video}}" controls class="organize-video" />
      <view wx:else class="organize-video-empty" bindtap="capture"><view class="organize-video-icon"><view></view></view><text class="organize-empty-title">留住现场示范和指导</text><text class="organize-empty-subtitle">已有录制可以稍后补充，也可以先整理资料</text></view>
      <view class="organize-video-footer"><text class="organize-caption">把现场示范与方案中的动作对应</text><button class="organize-button organize-button-small organize-button-soft" bindtap="capture">{{video ? '继续录视频' : '补充现场视频'}}<text class="organize-button-plus">＋</text></button></view>
    </view>
    <view class="organize-card">
      <view class="organize-section-heading"><view class="organize-section-name"><text class="organize-step">02</text><text class="organize-heading">补充收到的资料</text></view><text class="organize-optional">可稍后补</text></view>
      <text class="organize-section-note">拍照或从相册添加，识别后再和视频对应。</text>
      <view class="organize-document-grid">
        <view class="organize-upload-tile" bindtap="uploadDocument" data-type="medical"><view class="organize-upload-top"><view class="organize-file-icon organize-file-medical"><text>＋</text><view></view></view><text class="organize-upload-plus">＋</text></view><text class="organize-tile-title">病例单</text><text class="organize-tile-note">补充病情与注意事项</text></view>
        <view class="organize-upload-tile" bindtap="uploadDocument" data-type="training"><view class="organize-upload-top"><view class="organize-file-icon organize-file-training"><view></view><view></view><view></view></view><text class="organize-upload-plus">＋</text></view><text class="organize-tile-title">训练方案单</text><text class="organize-tile-note">提取动作与训练要求</text></view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{documents.length}}" class="organize-documents">
        <view wx:for="{{documents}}" wx:key="id" class="organize-document"><view class="organize-document-main"><image class="organize-document-thumb" src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="previewDocument" data-id="{{item.id}}" /><view class="organize-document-info"><view class="organize-document-title-line"><text class="organize-document-title">{{item.typeLabel}}</text><text class="organize-document-status {{item.error ? 'organize-text-error' : ''}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><text class="organize-document-excerpt">{{item.error || item.shortText || '资料已保存，等待识别文字'}}</text><view class="organize-document-actions"><text class="organize-link" bindtap="previewDocument" data-id="{{item.id}}">查看原件</text><text wx:if="{{!item.recognizing}}" class="organize-link" bindtap="editDocumentText" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.shortText ? '校对原文' : '手动录入'}}</text><text wx:if="{{!item.recognizing && (item.status === 'pending' || item.status === 'failed')}}" class="organize-link" bindtap="recognizeOne" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.status === 'failed' ? '重试识别' : '识别文字'}}</text></view></view></view></view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{manualTextOpen}}" class="organize-transcript"><view class="organize-transcript-title-line"><text class="organize-document-title">{{activeDocumentTypeLabel}} · 原文校对</text><text class="organize-caption">可手动补充</text></view><textarea class="organize-input organize-transcript-input" value="{{documentText}}" bindinput="inputDocumentText" maxlength="12000" placeholder="输入或粘贴单据中的原文，保留动作名称、组次、时长与频次等要求" /><view class="organize-transcript-buttons"><button class="organize-button organize-button-soft organize-button-small" bindtap="cancelDocumentText">取消</button><button class="organize-button organize-button-small" bindtap="saveDocumentText">保存原文并整理</button></view></view>
      <button class="organize-button organize-recognize-button" bindtap="recognizeDocuments" disabled="{{recognizing || !documents.length}}">{{recognizing ? recognizingLabel : '识别并整理资料'}}</button>
      <view class="organize-footnote"><text class="organize-footnote-mark">i</text><text>识别后请对照原件核对；缺少的要求留空补充。</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{contextText}}" class="organize-context"><view class="organize-context-heading" bindtap="toggleContext"><text class="organize-document-title">病例资料摘录</text><text class="organize-caption">{{contextExpanded ? '收起⌃' : '展开⌄'}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{contextExpanded}}" class="organize-context-text">{{contextText}}</text></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{showRecognizedActions}}" class="organize-card">
      <view class="organize-section-heading"><view class="organize-section-name"><text class="organize-step">03</text><text class="organize-heading">核对并对应到视频</text></view><text wx:if="{{actionCount}}" class="organize-count">{{actionCount}} 个动作</text></view>
      <text class="organize-section-note">选择方案中与当前视频对应的动作，再核对下方要求。</text>
      <view wx:for="{{actionItems}}" wx:key="id" class="organize-candidate" bindtap="applyCandidate" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="organize-candidate-heading"><text class="organize-candidate-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="organize-candidate-link">对应此视频 →</text></view><text class="organize-candidate-dose">{{item.dose || '训练量待补充'}}<text wx:if="{{item.frequency}}"> · {{item.frequency}}</text></text><text wx:if="{{item.sourceText}}" class="organize-candidate-source">原文：{{item.sourceText}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.matchLabel}}" class="organize-candidate-match">{{item.matchLabel}}</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!actionCount}}" class="organize-no-actions"><text class="organize-document-title">暂未提取到明确的动作要求</text><text class="organize-section-note">可校对资料原文，或按已收到的现场指导手动补充。</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="organize-card organize-requirements">
      <view class="organize-manual-heading" bindtap="toggleManual"><view class="organize-section-name"><text class="organize-step">{{showRecognizedActions ? '04' : '03'}}</text><text class="organize-heading">当前动作要求</text></view><text class="organize-link">{{manualExpanded ? '收起⌃' : '手动补充⌄'}}</text></view>
      <text wx:if="{{!manualExpanded}}" class="organize-section-note">资料未收到，也可以根据明确的现场指导填写。</text>
      <block wx:if="{{manualExpanded}}">
        <view wx:if="{{sourceText}}" class="organize-source"><text class="organize-source-label">对应原文</text><text class="organize-source-text">{{sourceText}}</text></view>
        <view wx:if="{{sourceDoseText}}" class="organize-source"><text class="organize-source-label">原方案要求</text><text class="organize-source-text">{{sourceDoseText}}</text></view>
        <text class="organize-label">动作名称</text><input class="organize-input" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写现场指导中的动作名称" />
        <text class="organize-label">动作组别<text class="organize-label-optional">选填</text></text><input class="organize-input" value="{{groupName}}" data-field="groupName" bindinput="input" maxlength="80" placeholder="如柔韧性练习、3D矫正练习" />
        <text class="organize-label">个人要点<text class="organize-label-optional">选填</text></text><textarea class="organize-input organize-notes" value="{{notes}}" data-field="notes" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" placeholder="如摆位、发力、呼吸和需要注意的地方" />
        <text class="organize-label">完成量单位</text><view class="organize-modes"><text wx:for="{{modes}}" wx:key="key" data-mode="{{item.key}}" bindtap="mode" class="{{mode === item.key ? 'organize-mode-selected' : ''}}">{{item.label}}</text></view>
        <view class="organize-dose-grid"><view><text class="organize-label">组数</text><view class="organize-input-unit"><input class="organize-input" type="number" value="{{sets}}" data-field="sets" bindinput="input" placeholder="待确认" /><text>组</text></view></view><view><text class="organize-label">每组完成量</text><view class="organize-input-unit"><input class="organize-input" type="number" value="{{amount}}" data-field="amount" bindinput="input" placeholder="待确认" /><text>{{unit}}</text></view></view></view>
        <view wx:if="{{frequencyText}}" class="organize-frequency"><text class="organize-source-label">方案频次</text><text>{{frequencyText}}</text><text class="organize-caption">保存后在训练计划中确认安排。</text></view>
        <view wx:if="{{warnings.length}}" class="organize-warnings"><text wx:for="{{warnings}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view>
        <view class="organize-confirm" bindtap="check" aria-role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{checked}}"><view class="organize-checkbox {{checked ? 'organize-checkbox-checked' : ''}}">{{checked ? '✓' : ''}}</view><text>已对照原件或明确的现场指导，核对以上要求</text></view><text class="organize-confirm-note">未确认的要求可留空，先保存为草稿。</text>
      </block>
    </view>
    <view class="organize-save-area"><button wx:if="{{manualExpanded}}" class="organize-button organize-save-button" bindtap="saveConfirmed">核对并保存动作卡</button><button wx:if="{{confirmed}}" class="organize-button organize-button-soft" bindtap="plan">加入训练计划</button><button class="organize-button organize-draft-button" bindtap="saveDraft">先存草稿</button><text class="organize-bottom-note">视频、资料和训练要求，都保存在这一张动作卡里</text></view>
  </block>
  <view wx:elif="{{tab === 'practice'}}" class="organize-card"><text class="organize-heading">按计划练习</text><text class="organize-practice-dose">{{sets || '待填写'}} 组 × {{amount || '待填写'}} {{unit}}</text><text class="organize-section-note">从训练首页进入已确认的计划，跟练和手动记录共用进度。</text><button class="organize-button" bindtap="plan">安排到训练计划</button></view>
  <block wx:else><view class="organize-card"><text class="organize-heading">示范与我的练习</text><video wx:if="{{video}}" src="{{video}}" controls class="organize-video" /><video wx:if="{{practice}}" src="{{practice}}" controls class="organize-video" /><button class="organize-button organize-button-soft" bindtap="capturePractice">录制我的练习对照视频</button><text wx:if="{{!practice}}" class="organize-section-note">暂未保存练习对照视频。</text></view><view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" class="organize-card"><text class="organize-heading">{{item.date}}</text><text class="organize-section-note">当时要求：{{item.dose}}</text><text class="organize-history-actual">实际：{{item.actual}} {{item.unit}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!history.length}}" class="organize-card organize-history-empty">还没有实际练习记录。</view></block>
</view>
